" === Tridactyl config — modal editing en Firefox ===
" Documentacion: https://github.com/tridactyl/tridactyl

" --- Hint characters
set hintchars qwertyuiop
set hintnames normal

" --- Search engines
searchengine duckduckgo https://duckduckgo.com/?q={}

" --- Theme
set theme default

" --- Bindings customizados
bind j scrollLineDown
bind k scrollLineUp
bind gg scrollToTop
bind G scrollToBottom
bind ZZ tabclose
bind ,t tabopen
bind ,b buffer
bind ,h hint -c [href*]

" --- Navegacion
bind gh home
bind gH tabopen home

" --- Yank URL
bind yY document.title + ' - ' + document.URL | yank

" --- Smooth scroll
set smoothscroll true

" --- Follow hints with newline
" set mode_hint_after ???
